# Actual 100-coin clear and SRAM reload with player/camera coordinate shortcuts.
# No coin, life, controller, goal or save writes. Not an unassisted route.
# Upper-inner entrance after restoring room 007 graphics.
# Clean-session input route shared by reference and native hosts.
# No WRAM pokes or imported savestates. All waits are guest-frame counts.
wait 600
dump title
press start 2
wait 180
dump files
press start 2
wait 900
dump intro
press b 30
wait 180
press a 30
wait 180
dump map

# Practice map transfer: map 6, X=0x178, Y=0x1c8.
